  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.golden_ball_1": "A heavy little ball with a frosted sheen",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.golden_ball_2": "Holding it, you can feel a warm, immense energy slowly coursing through it",

  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.nephrite_1": "A light, translucent rock, jade-like yet not, indestructible",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.nephrite_2": "Weightless in hand, yet it deforms under slight pressure",

  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.armor_fragments_1": "A heavy, jet-black armor fragment, its original location unidentifiable",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.armor_fragments_2": "Clear signs of melting are visible, some parts still encase the original wearer's bones",

  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.energetic_crystal_1": "A sparkling, deep and dark amethyst",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.energetic_crystal_2": "With the naked eye, one can see vast, arcane energy flowing along every crystalline structure",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.energetic_crystal_3": "Holding it, you feel it gently pulsating",

  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.astralium_1": "A cold, heavy raw ore, incredibly hard",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.astralium_2": "Upon closer inspection, the surface is covered with layers of wavy light-colored patterns",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.astralium_3": "This mineral doesn't seem to belong to this world, it's far too solid.",

  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.mimetic_ley_line_1": "Looks like a small piece of deepslate.",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.mimetic_ley_line_2": "Its immense weight and eerie hardness betray it's no ordinary rock.",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.mimetic_ley_line_3": "How can it be activated?",

  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.flame_crystal_cluster_1": "A very beautiful crystal cluster",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.flame_crystal_cluster_2": "Wrapped in a deep red crystalline membrane, the inner patterns resemble dancing flames.",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.flame_crystal_cluster_3": "Feels extremely hot to the touch.",

  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.flame_crystal_1": "A hot red crystal",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.flame_crystal_2": "The flame patterns inside seem to be flickering,",
  "ore_dredging.cimelia_introduction.flame_crystal_3": "It constantly radiates a beautiful yet dangerous aura, revealing the immense energy within.",

